## Benchmark artifacts written by docs/static/benchmarks/*.mjs
## Both files are script output — `--resample` rewrites the sample, every run rewrites the results —
## and `JSON.stringify` cannot reproduce the formatter's array-wrapping decisions. Formatting them
## means a reader who re-runs a published panel fails `yarn lint:oxfmt` on the artifact the panel
## exists to produce. Measured 2026-08-04: be-results.json was the file that tripped it.
## be-panel.json is hand-written input and stays formatted.
docs/static/benchmarks/fr-ban-sample.json
docs/static/benchmarks/*-results.json

